<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,onMounted,onUnmounted,computed} from 'vue';
const tab=ref('练习反馈'),difficulty=ref(0),paused=ref(false),hover=ref(-1),elapsed=ref(0);
const profiles=[{name:'简单',count:3,speed:24},{name:'普通',count:5,speed:40},{name:'困难',count:7,speed:60}];
const words=['学习','我','中华人民共和国','输入法','𠮷','方法','练习'];
const positions=ref(Array(7).fill(0));let frame=0,last=0;
const profile=computed(()=>profiles[difficulty.value]!);
function reset(){positions.value=words.map((_,i)=>-i*48);elapsed.value=0;}
function animate(now:number){const dt=last?Math.min((now-last)/1000,.1):0;last=now;if(!paused.value&&tab.value==='游戏参数'){elapsed.value+=dt;positions.value=positions.value.map((y,i)=>i===hover.value?y:(y+profile.value.speed*dt>360?-70:y+profile.value.speed*dt));}frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate);}
onMounted(()=>{reset();frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate)});onUnmounted(()=>cancelAnimationFrame(frame));
</script>
<template><main class="gallery"><h1>关键页面布局实验</h1><p>固定样例 · 不读写词库和学习数据；参数仅用于阶段 0 可行性验证。</p><nav><button v-for="name in ['练习反馈','文本添加','添加结果','设置','游戏参数']" @click="tab=name">{{name}}</button><a href="./index.html">输入验收</a></nav>
<section v-if="tab==='练习反馈'"><h2>词组练习</h2><p>剩余 02:30　已练过 12 / 100　暂时熟练 4 / 100</p><div class="tiles"><article v-for="(word,i) in words"><strong>{{word}}</strong><small>{{i===1?'q（示例编码）':'　'}}</small><span :class="i===1?'wrong':'right'">{{i===1?'你':word}}</span></article></div><p>一题一列，反馈跟随题目换行。罕见字：𠮷 𠀀。</p></section>
<section v-if="tab==='文本添加'" class="tray"><h2>添加生词</h2><p>粘贴一段文字，点击添加后查看本次新增。</p><textarea aria-label="添加文本">学习输入法</textarea><button @click="tab='添加结果'">添加（演示）</button></section>
<section v-if="tab==='添加结果'" class="tray"><h2>本次新增</h2><p>新增 2 个文字编码组合 · 忽略 1 个重复</p><ul><li>学习 <code>ipnu</code></li><li>输入法 <code>示例编码</code></li></ul><button @click="tab='文本添加'">继续添加（演示）</button></section>
<section v-if="tab==='设置'"><h2>练习设置</h2><label>练习组大小 <input type="number" value="20" min="5" max="100"></label><label>熟练阈值 <input type="number" value="3" min="1" max="10"></label><p>修改后下次开局生效，此处仅展示布局。</p><h3>文件交换</h3><button>生词 CSV 导入 / 导出（示例）</button><button>补充词库 CSV 导入 / 导出（示例）</button></section>
<section v-if="tab==='游戏参数'"><h2>下落布局实验</h2><select v-model="difficulty" @change="reset"><option v-for="(p,i) in profiles" :value="i">{{p.name}} · {{p.count}} 个 · {{p.speed}} px/s</option></select><button @click="paused=!paused">{{paused?'继续':'暂停'}}</button><p>有效时间 {{elapsed.toFixed(1)}} 秒。悬停冻结单目标；落底循环不记错。</p><div class="arena" :style="{gridTemplateColumns:`repeat(${profile.count},minmax(0,1fr))`}"><div v-for="(word,i) in words.slice(0,profile.count)" class="lane"><span class="target" :style="{transform:`translateY(${positions[i]}px)`}" @mouseenter="hover=i" @mouseleave="hover=-1">{{word}}<small v-if="hover===i">编码提示样例</small></span></div></div><p>独立列避免横向重叠；长词换行。窄窗口应减少目标或切换布局，正式参数仍可调优。</p></section></main></template>
<style>.gallery{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:24px;font:16px/1.6 system-ui}.gallery nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.gallery section{padding:24px;background:white;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;border-radius:12px;margin-top:20px}.gallery button,.gallery select,.gallery input{font:inherit;padding:8px;margin:4px}.tiles{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px}.tiles article{display:flex;flex-direction:column;text-align:center;font-size:24px;max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.tiles small{font-size:13px}.right{color:#267343}.wrong{color:#b52c38}.tray{max-width:420px}.tray textarea{width:100%;height:140px;font:inherit;box-sizing:border-box}.gallery label{display:block;margin:16px 0}.arena{display:grid;height:420px;overflow:hidden;background:#edf2fa;gap:12px}.lane{position:relative;min-width:0}.target{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:center;background:white;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;box-sizing:border-box}.target small{display:block;font-size:11px}</style>
